narrator: Chapter 3 Extra
# sprite center fuutarou neck_scratch
fuutarou: Really, why is this floor so slippery? Can't they just-whoa!
Fuutarou slips and slides all the way back to the inn. Once he hits the front door, he sees the grandpa standing there with a mop.
# sprite left fuutarou surprised
# sprite right grandpa relieved_smile
grandpa: Do you like it? I like to keep this place clean.
As he walks away, Fuutarou wonders just what is up with that old man.
# sprite hide all

